# Path globs exempt from scripts/secret-scan.sh. One glob per line.
# '*' matches across '/', so 'dir/*' covers a whole tree. Every entry needs a
# comment saying why it is allowed. Prefer a plain sentinel or a runtime-built
# string in tests over adding an entry here.

# Reserved home for fixtures that must contain real-shaped secrets verbatim
# (for example inputs to the secret scanner). Mirrors .gitguardian.yaml.
tests/fixtures/secret-shaped/*
